{"availability":"available","full":"Pasitearko/white-album-diary","name":"white-album-diary","description":"纯前端单文件日记本：无后端、无账号，数据只留在本地 · A single-file, browser-only diary — no backend, no account, everything stays on your machine.","category":"Other","language":"HTML","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2026-09-16T09:26:19Z","updated":"2026-09-28T05:21:44Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://pasitearko.github.io/white-album-diary/","topics":["diary","diary-app","echarts","github-pages","indexeddb","journal","local-first","offline-first","privacy","single-file","vanilla-javascript","white-album"],"demo":"https://pasitearko.github.io/white-album-diary/","color":"#302e55","ink":"#dbd2ff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T20:10:25.304Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-08T20:10:25.304Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-08T20:10:25.304Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-08T20:10:25.304Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["一本只属于你自己的日记本：纯前端、单文件，数据全部留在本地。 A quiet diary that lives entirely in your browser — one HTML file, no backend, no account.","White Album is a diary that runs entirely in your browser. The whole app is a single index.html: nothing to install, no build step, no command line — just open the file. There is no server and no account, and everything you write stays on your own machine by default.","Visually it follows the white-and-ice-blue mood of WHITE ALBUM 2, built on the design language of a macOS desktop app: the sidebar is the only place with a large glass surface, content cards are solid, and hierarchy comes from lightness and whitespace rather than stacked borders and shadows. The typeface split is deliberate — you write in a serif; the interface talks to you in a sans. Falling snow, wallpapers and background music carry the atmosphere. It is not meant to be a productivity tool, but a quiet corner — you can take your time today, and once the day is over, the page is sealed and…"],"features":["Multiple entries per day — start another one with “＋ New entry” and switch between them from the pills at the top","Sealed days — once the day has passed, that page becomes read-only. Past days can be re-read, not rewritten","Draft autosave — title (40 chars) and body (up to 20,000 chars) are saved as you type, with a live word count","Tags — add custom tags with Enter and filter the archive by them","Weather & mood — sunny / cloudy / overcast / rain / snow, and calm / joyful / wistful / tired / missing"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Pasitearko/white-album-diary/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"63e54797a9714d6d5b81d3bcf26660164a2ac3e81de457be4f72d34b879c959e","extractedAt":"2026-10-08T20:10:25.390Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T20:10:25.390Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"一本只属于你自己的日记本：纯前端、单文件，数据全部留在本地。 A quiet diary that lives entirely in your browser — one HTML file, no backend, no account.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Pasitearko/white-album-diary/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"account","status":"documented","text":"一本只属于你自己的日记本：纯前端、单文件，数据全部留在本地。 A quiet diary that lives entirely in your browser — one HTML file, no backend, no account.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Pasitearko/white-album-diary/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"account","status":"documented","text":"There is no server and no account, and everything you write stays on your own machine by default.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Pasitearko/white-album-diary/blob/main/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"63e54797a9714d6d5b81d3bcf26660164a2ac3e81de457be4f72d34b879c959e","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Pasitearko/white-album-diary/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-08T20:10:25.391Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-09-28T05:21:44Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Pasitearko/white-album-diary/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-08T20:10:25.393Z","hash":"63e54797a9714d6d5b81d3bcf26660164a2ac3e81de457be4f72d34